abstract: "Read-only RESTful API for academic bibliographic research: 78 documented operations over 7.6 million works and 7.7 million publications, 4.9 million researchers, venues, institutions, subjects, course bibliographies, citations and bibliometric rankings, with Manticore Search full-text search for works and persons over a MariaDB corpus."
